<section className="section scheme-section"><div className="container scheme-grid"><div className="scheme-copy"><span className="eyebrow">PM SURYA GHAR &#183; RESIDENTIAL ROOFTOP SOLAR</span><h2>Save on Eligible Rooftop Solar with PM Surya Ghar</h2><p className="scheme-lead">Eligible residential households may qualify for central government financial assistance under the PM Surya Ghar: Muft Bijli Yojana. We help you understand the eligibility requirements, documentation, and application process.</p><div className="subsidy-figure scheme-subsidy-highlight"><span>Government Subsidy</span><strong>UP TO &#8377;78,000</strong><small>Central subsidy available for eligible residential rooftop solar systems, subject to applicable scheme rules and approval.</small></div><div className="scheme-benefits">{[{title:'Understand Your Eligibility',description:'We help you understand the residential rooftop solar scheme requirements and identify the information needed before applying.'},{title:'Guidance With Documentation',description:'Get assistance understanding the required documents, electricity consumer details, bank information, and application requirements.'},{title:'Step-by-Step Application Guidance',description:'We explain the registration, application, installation, inspection, and subsidy-claim process so you know what to expect at each stage.'},{title:'Choose the Right Rooftop System',description:'We help you explore suitable solar panel capacity, equipment options, and installation requirements based on your property and electricity consumption.'}].map(item=><article className="scheme-benefit" key={item.title}><CheckCircle2 size={19}/><div><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.description}</p></div></article>)}</div><div className="scheme-process-wrap"><h3 className="scheme-process-title">How It Works</h3><ol className="scheme-process">{[{title:'Check Eligibility',description:'Review your residential electricity connection and scheme requirements.'},{title:'Prepare Your Application',description:'Understand the information and documents needed for registration.'},{title:'Install the Solar System',description:'Proceed according to the applicable portal process, feasibility requirements, and installation rules.'},{title:'Complete Required Formalities',description:'Follow the applicable inspection, commissioning, and subsidy-claim steps.'}].map((step,index)=><li className="scheme-process-step" key={step.title}><span>{String(index+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><div><h4>{step.title}</h4><p>{step.description}</p></div></li>)}</ol></div><div className="inline-actions"><CTA to="/contact">Check My Subsidy Eligibility</CTA><CTA to="/pm-surya-ghar-subsidy" secondary>Read the Complete Guide</CTA></div><p className="scheme-disclaimer">DANGI SOLAR SOLUTIONS can guide you through eligibility information, documentation requirements, and the application process. Subsidy eligibility, approval, and payment are determined under the applicable government scheme rules. The subsidy is not guaranteed. This section concerns eligible residential rooftop solar installations only; requirements must be checked against current official guidelines.</p></div><div className="scheme-visual"><img src="/PM-Surya Ghar Solar Showcase.png" alt="PM Surya Ghar rooftop solar showcase" loading="lazy"/><div className="image-note"><span className="note-icon"><ShieldCheck/></span><div><b>Understand before you invest</b><small>Check official eligibility and process requirements</small></div></div></div></div></section>
